Initial runner attempt: the Tank measurement variant tried to edit `ease` on the Measure page. The app exposes `ease` on Fit allowance page 2, while the active Measure page selector listed only `["0","1"]`; the runner correctly stopped before rendering. This was a UI-stage mismatch, not a product failure. Removed `ease` from the measurement overrides; the replay keeps the default Fit allowance and exercises only fields available on Measure.
